                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-route; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "A competitive and toughened ecosystem supports aggressive lifeforms.",
                        "target":  "竞争激烈且经过磨砺的生态系统孕育出攻击性生命形态。",
