                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-ecology; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "A competitive ecosystem supports aggressive lifeforms.",
                        "target":  "高度竞争的生态系统让攻击性生命形态得以存续。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-ecology; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "A frozen, flat landscape.",
                        "target":  "冰封而平坦的地貌。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-environment; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "A landscape of deep valleys and mountains.",
