                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-environment; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Abandoned",
                        "target":  "已废弃区域",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-status; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Abandoned facilities are littered across the landscape, which was once teeming with life.",
                        "target":  "废弃设施散落在地表各处；这里曾经充满生命迹象。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-history; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Arid. Low habitability, worsened by industrial artifacts.",
                        "target":  "干旱。宜居性偏低，并受到工业遗迹进一步恶化。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-environment; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Arid. Thick haze, worsened by industrial artifacts.",
                        "target":  "干旱且浓雾弥漫，工业遗迹使环境更加恶劣。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-environment; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Believed to have splintered off from its cousin Assurance",
                        "target":  "据信它从近亲天体 Assurance 分离而来",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-history; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "but there is now no sign of life, and they have become a mystery.",
                        "target":  "但如今已没有生命迹象，它们也成了未解之谜。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-history; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
