                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-history; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Erosion and geographical forces have resulted in a landscape of deep valleys and mountains.",
                        "target":  "侵蚀作用与地质力量塑造出深谷和山脉交错的地貌。",
                        "mode":  "translate",
                        "note":  "clean-runtime-overlay category=moon-environment; status=draft-self-authored"
                    },
                    {
                        "source":  "Expansive. Constant rain.",
